=4289814e217b28d7dfe53223acb6bbeb 3x"}, "body": "Mr. Nocturnal Owl\n\nPlease excuse my sudden message.\nMy name is Ushimitsu Moumou, and I am an individual Vtuber.\nI saw your illustration on X, and I was wondering if I could request you to create a key visual for me.\n\nI would like to use it for the following purposes.\nKey visual for the fixed post of X\n\nCharacter\nA young man who likes to drink and is a yokai named Gyukki.\nWears kimono and gloves\nHe has red demon horns, cow ears and a tail (the tip of the tail is gray in the material, but in reality it is pitch black)\n\nElements and composition\nFull-body portrait facing the front\nSimple background (e.g., all white)\nThe figure is holding a sake bottle in his left hand and a boar's mouth in his right.\nI would like to leave the specific pose to you.\n\n[Materials\nFixed post of current X\n\nhttps://twitter.com/ushimitsumomo/status/1715571145398010210\n\nThank you very much for your time and consideration.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/ushimitsumomo/status/1715571145398010210", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@noya_hu9ro/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2552022, "client_id": 1187515, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d15a20023690938904adf2d6d329bf3e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d15a20023690938904adf2d6d329bf3e, https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ae159d58268037c6079e882d569744d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb511fc0b9b6296f51d256dc43b53dc3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e4076593d1e328a6344c9dd726d15748", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e4076593d1e328a6344c9dd726d15748, https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=281d03466c4e5fabde983fcc56b81846 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6607e13ed8680bbcc543a7a1afdf7aa1 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nMy name is \u65af\u6bd4, a Vtuber from Taiwan.\nI would like to ask you to illustrate my friend's Vtuber.\n\n\u25b6\ufe0fSummary of the setting\nIrroc-\n\uff5cMy body is a rabbit\n\uff5cHe is a puppeteer who has a contract with a dying butler.\n\n\u25b6\ufe0f image reference\nIrroc-\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-0NXqGZmtXnD6E2EXXZK7PrvcC9ToxIi\n\n\u25b6\ufe0f Usage\nUse as thumbnails on YouTube\nIntroduction of the picture in the video streaming\nPosting on SNS such as Twitter\nUse for icons and headers\nIf possible, we would like to make and sell a small quantity of goods. (If this is not allowed, we would appreciate it if you could state so in a separate layer.)\n\n\u25b6\ufe0f Size\n16:9 ratio (1280720 / 19201080)\n\uff5cComposition is up to you!\n\uff5cFeel free to change the clothing as you like!\n\uff5cWe would appreciate it if you could put the person and the background on separate layers.\n\nWe prefer to receive the image in png or psd format.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-0NXqGZmtXnD6E2EXXZK7PrvcC9ToxIi", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@noya_hu9ro/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a6a61afd/uploads/origins/1dbab4b3-977d-4cc9-b0ac-bd257c63174e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=35c4311b01d7754fb9c4af46cad0d5a9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a6a61afd/uploads/origins/1dbab4b3-977d-4cc9-b0ac-bd257c63174e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=35c4311b01d7754fb9c4af46cad0d5a9, https://si.imgix.net/a6a61afd/uploads/origins/1dbab4b3-977d-4cc9-b0ac-bd257c63174e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2130b072dea6ba3bf02cfbe31b0bbb2b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a6a61afd/uploads/origins/1dbab4b3-977d-4cc9-b0ac-bd257c63174e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=900de3b59d46fb50bfdf1df2819e9f0f 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2552022, "client_id": 1445692, "nc": 128}, {"path": "/@noya_hu9ro/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2552022, "client_id": 2936206, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7629f7b9/uploads/origins/f3f5abd2-4eb1-48b6-9a2f-06368ba169b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7620873d5a9eda9f0bd3e972e7a1085a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7629f7b9/uploads/origins/f3f5abd2-4eb1-48b6-9a2f-06368ba169b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7620873d5a9eda9f0bd3e972e7a1085a, https://si.imgix.net/7629f7b9/uploads/origins/f3f5abd2-4eb1-48b6-9a2f-06368ba169b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29745847bcc2d4906279ba734cf9634a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7629f7b9/uploads/origins/f3f5abd2-4eb1-48b6-9a2f-06368ba169b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7cb9702c2c4f16dbfb42efd3d5e3dd07 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7629f7b9/uploads/origins/f3f5abd2-4eb1-48b6-9a2f-06368ba169b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c9a1946c62031ed773a2299ca7f812a2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7629f7b9/uploads/origins/f3f5abd2-4eb1-48b6-9a2f-06368ba169b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c9a1946c62031ed773a2299ca7f812a2, https://si.imgix.net/7629f7b9/uploads/origins/f3f5abd2-4eb1-48b6-9a2f-06368ba169b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=118f0d7f209918f985c8f49886ed17e2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7629f7b9/uploads/origins/f3f5abd2-4eb1-48b6-9a2f-06368ba169b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=944cfae158fc075c10329ae6d8505442 3x"}, "body": "I love your art!  \n\nI would like to request art of the \u201cNU: Carnival\u201d character Blade in the outfit from this post:   \n\nhttps://x.com/nucarnival/status/1708059111500521615?s=46&t=ekoxxH2sNlCMX6BXnfMmIA   \n\nThe pose is up to you.  \n\nI may share it on social media with credit to you. Thank you.\n\nhttps://x.com/nucarnival/status/1708059111500521615?s=46&t=ekoxxH2sNlCMX6BXnfMmIA", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@noya_hu9ro/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2552022, "client_id": 2819743, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a90cdea85c7c85d1563a8fb5bf95f8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a90cdea85c7c85d1563a8fb5bf95f8, https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8898d856858e4c95f23692a5d7379d3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4989cfa5f4a9d6a25a6c4714dc122522 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c2eff3421d6a79029028219e3e5bb6b4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c2eff3421d6a79029028219e3e5bb6b4, https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c6cd18c6354bc820f402cec0b27dd020 2x, https://si.imgix.net/61ab3876/uploads/origins/ae88124f-f627-4bce-ad8e-abe58af40f86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=52f549c3d48d2e56036d1d66a321685d 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you. My name is Yuzuru Fujishiro and I am a private VTuber.\n\nI found you through a tag on Twitter, and I really like your illustrations of Nurarihyon's grandchildren and the way you paint your illustrations.\nI would like to ask you to draw an illustration including the background if you don't mind.\n\nI am a crane demon.\nThe humanoid is a girl of about 15 years old.\nShe is a crane demon and a land god of the wisteria forest.\nI like human children. I like human children so much that I hide them from the gods if I like them.\nShe has wisteria-colored eyes and twilight-colored odd eyes.\nShe has long gray (silver) hair that reaches her waist and hips.\nI would appreciate it if you could draw her in a horizontal 9:16 format.\nI would appreciate it if you could draw a human figure in the front and a demon figure in the back.\n\nWe would like to use the illustrations as icons, advertisements, thumbnails, etc. on Twitter, YouTube, etc.\nWe would appreciate it if you could enclose transparent backgrounds of the human figure and the demon figure, respectively.\n\nPlease feel free to draw the poses and backgrounds as you like.\nWe will provide the URL for the background and details, so please use it to get an idea of what you are looking for.\n\nWe are willing to add a commission fee to the drawing cost, as we expect the drawing cost to be high. We would really like you to draw it for us.\n\nWe understand that you are busy, but we would appreciate it very much.\n\nYuzuru Fujishiro\n\nhttps://lit.link/fujishiroyuduru", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@noya_hu9ro/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2552022, "client_id": 1229857, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8044de51/uploads/origins/4972619c-b0b6-4813-9586-4d425005a051?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=46660c77fdb1ad3bfd12ef6481